        "slc_8de021be3e29dd2203bbefff9274a8fa43fcdb1bb0be7d0c01b5bd7975c6d9d9"
      ],
      "text": "Claude Code is described as a large CLI with a 785KB main.tsx entry point using a React/Ink terminal renderer, 40+ tools, and multi-agent orchestration."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_e97b4284efb870561d375cdfbc05624473d889f7fe3aa0507dfd88296ffce8d7",
