        "slc_c0e4a776b418eac2b103e312f769f571b3b4e8b34668bf3e957471deaea39193"
      ],
      "text": "The described source layout includes main.tsx as CLI entrypoint, QueryEngine.ts for core LLM logic, a tools directory, services, a coordinator for swarm orchestration, a bridge for IDE integration, and a buddy directory."
    },
